  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>W. Schuster &amp; Co., wheelwrights, are listed in <ref target="civic?id=Sydney%20Road">Sydney Road</ref> from 1900 to 1930, at No. 38 to 1910 and Nos 36–42 from 1915. In 1895 the same number is Schuster &amp; Glaser, wheelwrights.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>The <ref target="civic?id=Harvest%20Home%20hotel">Harvest Home hotel</ref> is next door at No. 44 (Nos 44–46 from 1915) throughout. W. J. Banks, optician, is at No. 34 in 1910.</p>
      </div>
